01:32:13.333 --> 01:32:16.042
Give you a chance to think about
how you're going to play that.

1687
01:32:17.375 --> 01:32:19.083
- Whoa!
- Whoa!

1688
01:32:20.375 --> 01:32:23.375
Billy Jenkins,
you stepped on it and stepped in it.

1689
01:32:23.458 --> 01:32:25.417
Shut up, Edward Woodenhand.

1690
01:32:25.500 --> 01:32:28.917
Screw you, Cabbage Patch Kid.

1691
01:32:37.083 --> 01:32:38.667
Take your time.

1692
01:32:38.750 --> 01:32:40.458
Go get my lob wedge. Wait.

1693
01:32:43.292 --> 01:32:44.458
Go stand right there.

1694
01:32:52.833 --> 01:32:53.833
Okay.

1695
01:32:55.167 --> 01:32:56.708
Right in the back of the cup.

1696
01:32:59.542 --> 01:33:03.083
- No, don't get off! God!
- Oh!

1697
01:33:03.167 --> 01:33:04.333
- Vecsey!
- What?

1698
01:33:04.417 --> 01:33:05.750
God damn it.

1699
01:33:06.375 --> 01:33:08.292
Excuse me. Know what? You're fired.

1700
01:33:08.375 --> 01:33:09.542
Makes sense.

1701
01:33:09.625 --> 01:33:12.500
Will you quit messing this up
and make this? Come on.

1702
01:33:12.583 --> 01:33:14.208
I'm trying, sir.

1703
01:33:14.292 --> 01:33:15.833
Just get it on the right line.

1704
01:33:15.917 --> 01:33:17.542
Coming right up, sir.

1705
01:33:27.875 --> 01:33:32.375
<i>And Billy Jenkins is in for four.</i>

1706
01:33:32.458 --> 01:33:34.167
- Yeah!
- Choke on that one, Happy!

1707
01:33:34.833 --> 01:33:39.250
<i>Gilmore has only two shots left
to even tie this thing.</i>

1708
01:33:39.333 --> 01:33:43.625
<i>I'm not even playing and my palms
are sweaty. Mom's spaghetti.</i>

1709
01:33:44.333 --> 01:33:46.250
I can't get a damn swing off here.

1710
01:33:46.333 --> 01:33:48.542
You got any ideas? We're in trouble, dude.

1711
01:33:48.625 --> 01:33:51.667
Hmm. I say ricochet that shit.

1712
01:33:53.208 --> 01:33:54.500
Yeah, that's a good idea.

1713
01:34:02.125 --> 01:34:04.667
Amazing!

1714
01:34:04.750 --> 01:34:05.750
Did it go in?

1715
01:34:05.792 --> 01:34:07.250
Not that amazing.

1716
01:34:08.917 --> 01:34:10.292
You nervous?

1717
01:34:10.375 --> 01:34:13.500
No, just… Can I use your mailbox?

1718
01:34:13.583 --> 01:34:15.292
<i>The question now is,</i>

1719
01:34:15.375 --> 01:34:17.958
<i>how do you hit on a green
you can't stand on?</i>

1720
01:34:18.833 --> 01:34:19.833
What do I do?

1721
01:34:20.458 --> 01:34:21.917
Here we go, Dad!

1722
01:34:22.000 --> 01:34:24.042
- Dad, let's go!
- Let's go! All you!

1723
01:34:24.125 --> 01:34:25.625
- Right now!
- All right.

1724
01:34:25.708 --> 01:34:26.750
What's the plan?

1725
01:34:27.500 --> 01:34:28.750
How about this?

1726
01:34:28.833 --> 01:34:30.833
Go to the other side
directly across from me.

1727
01:34:30.917 --> 01:34:32.375
- Yes, sir.
- Okay.

1728
01:34:32.458 --> 01:34:34.583
- Oscar. Hey.
- Yeah, go!

1729
01:34:34.667 --> 01:34:36.875
Oh, God, I can't bear to watch.

1730
01:34:36.958 --> 01:34:39.333
Oscar, how much do you weigh?

1731
01:34:40.083 --> 01:34:41.458
170.

1732
01:34:42.333 --> 01:34:43.833
Pick up the bag, please.

1733
01:34:45.208 --> 01:34:47.000
Actually, take two clubs out.

1734
01:34:47.083 --> 01:34:49.458
Two clubs. Two. Two clubs.

1735
01:34:49.542 --> 01:34:51.625
Okay. Pick the bag up again.

1736
01:34:52.667 --> 01:34:55.500
And on the count of three,
we're stepping on the green.

1737
01:34:55.583 --> 01:34:57.625
- Okay.
- Are you ready?

1738
01:34:57.708 --> 01:35:03.167
And one, two… three!

1739
01:35:04.208 --> 01:35:05.375
Whoa, oh... Hey…

1740
01:35:06.500 --> 01:35:09.333
That's it. That's it.
Okay, we're gonna hop forward.

1741
01:35:09.417 --> 01:35:12.458
One. Two. Three.

1742
01:35:12.542 --> 01:35:15.250
Ooh.

1743
01:35:17.292 --> 01:35:18.417
<i>Okay.</i>

1744
01:35:20.083 --> 01:35:21.250
<i>Now to the left.</i>

1745
01:35:22.000 --> 01:35:24.167
One, two, three.

1746
01:35:25.375 --> 01:35:26.833
That's it.

1747
01:35:26.917 --> 01:35:30.417
Now we're gonna go sideways… Two, three.

1748
01:35:33.167 --> 01:35:36.000
Ooh, Oscar… Nice work.

1749
01:35:36.083 --> 01:35:37.583
Check this out.

1750
01:35:38.167 --> 01:35:39.167
Whoa!

1751
01:35:40.542 --> 01:35:42.625
- What's happening?
- What the…

1752
01:35:42.708 --> 01:35:46.375
Sorry, Happy, I had to.
We don't do tiebreakers at Maxi.

1753
01:35:46.458 --> 01:35:48.167
How about we raise the stakes?

1754
01:35:48.250 --> 01:35:50.542
I end this whole project
if you sink this putt.

1755
01:35:50.625 --> 01:35:51.958
And if I miss?

1756
01:35:52.042 --> 01:35:54.083
It's simple. You join Maxi League.

1757
01:35:59.792 --> 01:36:01.333
How about this?

1758
01:36:01.417 --> 01:36:03.125
You pay for my daughter's dance school,

1759
01:36:03.208 --> 01:36:04.625
buy me my grandma's house back,

1760
01:36:04.708 --> 01:36:06.625
plus I get your Rolls-Royce,

1761
01:36:07.375 --> 01:36:10.125
plus you gotta buy Oscar
his own restaurant.

1762
01:36:11.042 --> 01:36:12.833
What kind of restaurant
are we talking here?

1763
01:36:12.917 --> 01:36:14.458
What kind of food, Oscar?

1764
01:36:14.542 --> 01:36:16.917
Sushi. No, no, no. Italian.

1765
01:36:17.000 --> 01:36:18.875
Fine. You're on.

1766
01:36:18.958 --> 01:36:21.875
<i>You heard it.
There'll be no playoff today.</i>

1767
01:36:22.958 --> 01:36:24.125
Oscar, I have bad news.

1768
01:36:25.417 --> 01:36:27.333
I'm holding a sand wedge. I need a putter.

1769
01:36:29.000 --> 01:36:31.167
Just take it slowly out of the bag.

1770
01:36:32.500 --> 01:36:36.458
That's it. That's it. Take the sock off.

1771
01:36:36.542 --> 01:36:39.500
Okay, so we're gonna throw it
to each other on the count of three.

1772
01:36:39.583 --> 01:36:40.875
- Okay.
- We can do this.

1773
01:36:42.167 --> 01:36:45.292
One, two, three.

1774
01:36:46.042 --> 01:36:49.750
- Oh!
- Okay. I caught my own club.

1775
01:36:50.708 --> 01:36:52.708
Physics is a bitch, isn't it?

1776
01:36:53.542 --> 01:36:55.000
Here's what we're gonna do.

1777
01:36:55.083 --> 01:36:57.458
We're gonna throw it
straight up in the sky.

1778
01:36:57.542 --> 01:36:58.583
Let's do this.

1779
01:36:58.667 --> 01:37:00.458
Do not get sick, Oscar.

1780
01:37:00.542 --> 01:37:05.708
- Okay. One, two, three.
- One, two…

1781
01:37:10.292 --> 01:37:11.167
Yes!

1782
01:37:11.250 --> 01:37:13.833
Let's go! Let's go, Hap!

1783
01:37:13.917 --> 01:37:16.708
High five. High…

1784
01:37:18.083 --> 01:37:21.667
Hey, Gilmore can do this.
I've seen it. I lived it.

1785
01:37:22.458 --> 01:37:25.708
Wow. Cool.
How bout we take this to the Maxi?

1786
01:37:29.708 --> 01:37:31.292
He's gonna fly off.

1787
01:37:31.375 --> 01:37:33.833
- …spot, focus on the spot.
- You got it. Focus.

1788
01:37:35.000 --> 01:37:36.167
Oh, no.

1789
01:37:36.250 --> 01:37:38.083
Hang in there, Oscar, please.

1790
01:37:43.000 --> 01:37:45.625
Come on, Dad. You got it.

1791
01:37:45.708 --> 01:37:47.333
Dad!

1792
01:37:51.542 --> 01:37:53.458
Come on, Dad!

1793
01:37:56.125 --> 01:37:59.042
I love you so much!

1794
01:38:04.875 --> 01:38:09.708
Do it like my daddy taught you.
Tap it. Tap it in.

1795
01:38:19.333 --> 01:38:21.042
<i>It's got a chance.</i>

1796
01:38:22.167 --> 01:38:24.083
- Go.
- Go.

1797
01:38:24.167 --> 01:38:25.708
Come on, Happy.

1798
01:38:25.792 --> 01:38:28.042
- Come on, come on…
- Come on, come on, come on…

1799
01:38:33.417 --> 01:38:37.417
- Get there!
- Oh!

1800
01:38:37.500 --> 01:38:39.583
<i>Oh, no!</i>

1801
01:38:40.792 --> 01:38:44.458
Yes! Welcome to Maxi, Happy. Whoo!

1802
01:38:53.083 --> 01:38:58.125
Oh, my God! Happy Gilmore has won!

1803
01:38:59.000 --> 01:39:02.208
<i>And regular golf will live on.</i>

1804
01:39:03.583 --> 01:39:07.125
- I'm 8 Ball! I'm 8 Ball!
- No! That doesn't happen!

1805
01:39:07.208 --> 01:39:09.167
You are a piece of shit, you know that?

1806
01:39:09.250 --> 01:39:10.667
I did everything I could…

1807
01:39:10.750 --> 01:39:14.125
Oscar! We did it, Oscar!

1808
01:39:18.250 --> 01:39:20.667
<i>Papi, papi. </i>Wake up.

1809
01:39:21.333 --> 01:39:22.458
- Good job!
- Did we win?

1810
01:39:25.167 --> 01:39:26.542
- Yes!
- All right!

1811
01:39:26.625 --> 01:39:27.667
Happy, yes!

1812
01:39:27.750 --> 01:39:29.417
Yeah, yeah!

1813
01:39:29.500 --> 01:39:30.500
Stop.

1814
01:39:33.917 --> 01:39:37.958
Your training paid off. You did it.
I'm proud of you. I'm proud of you.

1815
01:39:38.042 --> 01:39:39.125
- Yes!
- Yes!

1816
01:39:41.042 --> 01:39:43.042
What a great win. Let's go to Hooters.

1817
01:39:50.958 --> 01:39:54.417
- Happy Gilmore! Happy Gilmore!
- Happy Gilmore! Happy Gilmore!

1818
01:39:54.500 --> 01:39:57.625
I can't believe I'm saying this,
but you're all free to go.

1819
01:39:57.708 --> 01:40:00.250
Beautiful.

1820
01:40:01.875 --> 01:40:04.833
Unbelievable. Tremendous.

1821
01:40:04.917 --> 01:40:06.542
I understand you have a restaurant.

1822
01:40:06.625 --> 01:40:11.333
We have the best Italian Dominican
Puerto Rican Cuban restaurant in the town.

1823
01:40:11.417 --> 01:40:13.250
I love my new job!

1824
01:40:13.333 --> 01:40:16.125
We did it, baby! We did it for Mom!

1825
01:40:25.125 --> 01:40:29.042
Well, I've won a lot of trophies
and jackets over the years,

1826
01:40:29.833 --> 01:40:35.292
but out of all of them, I have to say
this is by far the most special.

1827
01:40:36.333 --> 01:40:38.667
And I want to thank
all my friends out there

1828
01:40:38.750 --> 01:40:42.292
who helped me achieve
this monumental moment.

1829
01:40:45.125 --> 01:40:46.375
Three months sober.

1830
01:40:46.958 --> 01:40:49.375
Yay! Way to go, Mr. Gilmore!

1831
01:40:50.292 --> 01:40:52.833
Splendid! Splendid, Mr. Gilmore.

1832
01:40:53.750 --> 01:40:56.500
But will you make it to a year?

1833
01:40:56.583 --> 01:41:01.542
- Magic 8-Ball says… unlikely.
- Uh-huh.

1834
01:41:01.625 --> 01:41:05.542
What are you talking about, Hal?
Happy's going to make it a full lifetime.

1835
01:41:05.625 --> 01:41:07.333
Know what else is full, Charlotte?

1836
01:41:07.417 --> 01:41:11.042
My gutters. Full of dead leaves
and squirrel droppings.

1837
01:41:11.125 --> 01:41:12.917
But you'll be cleaning them out
this weekend.

1838
01:41:13.000 --> 01:41:15.125
I don't like the way you talk to that kid.

1839
01:41:15.208 --> 01:41:16.375
It's fine, Mr. Gilmore.

1840
01:41:16.458 --> 01:41:19.750
No, it's not fine. That kid has helped me
more than you have, Hal.

1841
01:41:19.833 --> 01:41:21.958
Seriously, Mr. Gilmore, I got this.

1842
01:41:22.042 --> 01:41:24.625
Guys, can we be done here?
We've got enough.

1843
01:41:24.708 --> 01:41:27.375
Why are you talking into your collar?
Are you high?

1844
01:41:28.792 --> 01:41:30.000
Are you high?

1845
01:41:31.583 --> 01:41:33.042
- Holy...
- Whoa!

1846
01:41:33.125 --> 01:41:34.917
Hallowicious Lieberman!

1847
01:41:35.000 --> 01:41:37.000
You're under arrest
for fraud and extortion.

1848
01:41:37.083 --> 01:41:39.583
We got enough footage of you
being a sick son of a bitch

1849
01:41:39.667 --> 01:41:41.417
to lock you away for a lifetime.

1850
01:41:42.292 --> 01:41:44.000
You narc'd on me?

1851
01:41:44.625 --> 01:41:45.542
Guess so.

1852
01:41:45.625 --> 01:41:48.042
Hey, man, I was just trying
to help these people.

1853
01:41:48.125 --> 01:41:51.292
Manual labor's therapeutically beneficial.

1854
01:41:51.375 --> 01:41:52.792
- Hey, Happy.
- What?

1855
01:41:52.875 --> 01:41:55.125
- Catch.
- Oh!

1856
01:41:56.208 --> 01:41:59.375
- I believe that's Mr. Gilmore's!
- He got my coin!

1857
01:41:59.458 --> 01:42:03.583
I got the coin!

1858
01:42:09.708 --> 01:42:11.958
- Oh, shit! Stop!
- Stay still!

1859
01:42:13.875 --> 01:42:15.458
You're a very cool kid.

1860
01:42:16.042 --> 01:42:19.333
You're a very cool guy.
You remind me of my dad.

1861
01:42:19.417 --> 01:42:20.417
Yeah?

1862
01:42:27.542 --> 01:42:29.250
All right, just have fun in Paris.

1863
01:42:29.333 --> 01:42:31.292
If you get homesick for America,

1864
01:42:31.375 --> 01:42:34.458
I can ship over some Yodels
or bottle rockets.

1865
01:42:34.542 --> 01:42:35.750
Whatever you guys want.

1866
01:42:35.833 --> 01:42:38.417
We'll be fine, Dad.
And we'll see you next month, right?

1867
01:42:38.500 --> 01:42:39.333
That's right.

1868
01:42:39.417 --> 01:42:42.333
I got the British Open,
I'll show up a week early, we'll hang out.

1869
01:42:42.417 --> 01:42:44.792
I want to see some
fancy French dancing from this kid.

1870
01:42:44.875 --> 01:42:46.375
Then you can come check out our show.

1871
01:42:46.458 --> 01:42:47.458
What show?

1872
01:42:47.542 --> 01:42:49.042
We're gonna be singing mimes.

1873
01:42:49.125 --> 01:42:50.875
I thought mimes aren't allowed to talk.

1874
01:42:50.958 --> 01:42:54.000
That's how we're gonna separate ourselves
from the other mimes, by singing.

1875
01:42:54.083 --> 01:42:55.125
Okay.

1876
01:42:55.208 --> 01:43:00.375
<i>We're trapped in a box!
Now we're tugging on a rope!</i>

1877
01:43:01.125 --> 01:43:03.250
<i>Even look at our sister…</i>

1878
01:43:03.333 --> 01:43:05.417
- And we'll kill you!
- And we'll crush you!

1879
01:43:05.500 --> 01:43:07.500
- I'll murder you!
- Don't you look at her!

1880
01:43:07.583 --> 01:43:10.083
- Smart. I love that!
- Nailed it. Really good.

1881
01:43:10.167 --> 01:43:11.625
Come here. Gonna miss you.

1882
01:43:11.708 --> 01:43:14.875
And if you're hungry on the flight,
enjoy the bread from Oscar's restaurant.

1883
01:43:14.958 --> 01:43:17.417
Go crush them over there for Mom.
Have a ball.

1884
01:43:17.500 --> 01:43:18.333
Love you, Dad.

1885
01:43:18.417 --> 01:43:20.500
- Hey, here you go.
- You're the best, guys.

1886
01:43:20.583 --> 01:43:22.542
- Sir, right there.
- There you go, buddy.

1887
01:43:22.625 --> 01:43:25.042
Yeah, get him!

1888
01:43:25.125 --> 01:43:26.375
I'm so sorry, sweetheart.

1889
01:43:26.458 --> 01:43:27.667
Come on, Vienna.

1890
01:43:29.583 --> 01:43:31.292
Love you. I'll miss you.

1891
01:43:34.500 --> 01:43:40.208
<i>Tuesday's gone with the wind</i>

1892
01:43:45.167 --> 01:43:46.708
Hey, Happy.

1893
01:43:53.667 --> 01:43:58.583
<i>Tuesday's gone with the wind</i>

1894
01:43:58.667 --> 01:44:00.708
Oh. You're okay.

1895
01:44:03.167 --> 01:44:08.792
<i>My baby's gone with the wind</i>

1896
01:44:10.417 --> 01:44:13.625
<i>Train roll on</i>

1897
01:44:15.750 --> 01:44:18.333
<i>Tuesday's gone</i>

1898
01:44:18.417 --> 01:44:22.333
<i>Battery, zero percent.</i>

1899
01:44:22.417 --> 01:44:24.458
I didn't charge it! Damn it!

1900
01:44:43.958 --> 01:44:47.792
<i>Oh, baby
Don't it feel like heaven right now?</i>

1901
01:44:47.875 --> 01:44:51.125
<i>Don't it feel like something
From a dream?</i>

1902
01:44:51.875 --> 01:44:55.917
<i>Yeah, I've never known
Nothing quite like this</i>

1903
01:44:56.000 --> 01:45:00.042
<i>Don't it feel like tonight
Might never be again?</i>

1904
01:45:00.125 --> 01:45:04.042
<i>Baby, we know better
Than to try and pretend</i>

1905
01:45:04.125 --> 01:45:07.917
<i>Honey no one
Coulda ever told me 'bout this</i>

1906
01:45:08.000 --> 01:45:10.542
<i>-I said yeah, yeah
-Yeah, yeah</i>

1907
01:45:10.625 --> 01:45:12.375
<i>Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah</i>

1908
01:45:12.458 --> 01:45:16.458
<i>The waiting is the hardest part</i>

1909
01:45:16.542 --> 01:45:20.292
<i>Every day you see one more card</i>

1910
01:45:20.375 --> 01:45:24.417
<i>You take it on faith
You take it to the heart</i>

1911
01:45:24.500 --> 01:45:28.667
<i>The waiting is the hardest part</i>

1912
01:45:32.250 --> 01:45:36.208
<i>Well, yeah, I might have chased
A couple women around</i>

1913
01:45:36.292 --> 01:45:40.083
<i>All it ever got me was down</i>

1914
01:45:40.167 --> 01:45:44.417
<i>Then there were those
That made me feel good</i>

1915
01:45:44.500 --> 01:45:48.375
<i>But never as good as I feel right now</i>

1916
01:45:48.458 --> 01:45:52.667
<i>Baby, you're the only one
That's ever known how</i>

1917
01:45:52.750 --> 01:45:54.500
<i>To make me wanna live…</i>

1918
01:45:54.583 --> 01:45:56.792
<i>Well, the bad news
just keeps coming for Maxi</i>

1919
01:45:56.875 --> 01:45:59.708
<i>and its controversial founder,
Francis Manatee.</i>

1920
01:45:59.792 --> 01:46:03.000
<i>Since the spectacular failure
of the Maxi Golf League,</i>

1921
01:46:03.083 --> 01:46:07.167
<i>the popular Maxi Sports Drink
has been recalled after complaints</i>

1922
01:46:07.250 --> 01:46:10.833
<i>it caused irreversible halitosis,
gingivitis,</i>

1923
01:46:10.917 --> 01:46:13.750
<i>and a new condition
they're calling tongue rot.</i>

1924
01:46:14.417 --> 01:46:17.250
<i>We at the Sports Hole
tried to reach Manatee for comment,</i>

